.nh
.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-v2-activity-logs-list - List activity logs


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago v2 activity-logs list [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Returns a cursor-paginated list ordered by log time, newest first. Use after or before to navigate. The page and per_page parameters are rejected.
Requires a premium license and available log storage. Results are ordered by logged_at and activity_id, both descending, within the configured retention period.
Requires the product catalog to be enabled and activity_log read permission on the API key.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--activity-sources\fP=""
	Activity sources[].

.PP
\fB--activity-types\fP=""
	Activity types[].

.PP
\fB--after\fP=""
	Opaque next_cursor from a previous response. Returns the next page. Cannot be combined with before or include_total_count=true. Keep the same filters when paging.

.PP
\fB--all\fP[=false]
	Fetch every page by following next_cursor

.PP
\fB--before\fP=""
	Opaque prev_cursor from a previous response. Returns the previous page in the same list order. Cannot be combined with after or include_total_count=true. Keep the same filters when paging.

.PP
\fB--external-customer-id\fP=""
	External customer id.

.PP
\fB--external-subscription-id\fP=""
	External subscription id.

.PP
\fB--from-date\fP=""
